  "Create a git commit for the current changes. Steps, each as a real tool call: 1) \"git status\" and \"git diff\" to see what changed. 2) Group the changes and stage the right files (\"git add\"). 3) Write a clear Conventional-Commits message (type(scope): summary, then a short body explaining WHY). 4) Commit. 5) Show the resulting \"git log -1 --stat\".": "为当前更改创建 git 提交。各步骤均需实际调用工具：1) 运行 \"git status\" 和 \"git diff\" 查看更改内容。2) 对更改分组并暂存相应文件（\"git add\"）。3) 编写清晰的 Conventional-Commits 提交信息（type(scope): summary，然后简短正文说明原因）。4) 提交。5) 显示生成的 \"git log -1 --stat\"。",
