  "This pulls the latest ComfyUI and reinstalls its Python packages. It can take a few minutes. If ComfyUI is running and this app started it, it will be stopped first; a ComfyUI this app did not start blocks the update instead. ComfyUI starts again when the update is done.": "此操作会拉取最新版 ComfyUI 并重新安装其 Python 包，可能需要几分钟。如果 ComfyUI 正在运行且由本应用启动，会先将其停止；若 ComfyUI 不是由本应用启动，则会阻止更新。更新完成后 ComfyUI 会重新启动。",
  "This render is no longer on disk.": "此渲染图已不在磁盘上。",
  "This sets up Apple MLX on this Mac and downloads the smallest image model to start with,": "此操作将在此 Mac 上设置 Apple MLX，并下载最小的图像模型作为起点，",
