  "This sets up Apple MLX video on this Mac and downloads a video model to start with. Video renders take minutes per clip, not seconds. More models are in Models, under Video.": "此操作将在此 Mac 上设置 Apple MLX 视频，并下载一个视频模型作为起点。视频渲染每段需要数分钟，而非数秒。更多模型位于“模型”下的“视频”中。",
  "This sets up everything for a fully local run: ComfyUI itself if it’s missing, plus the Juggernaut XL starter checkpoint (~6.5 GB). That same model also powers the local Edit tab.": "此操作为完全本地运行准备好一切：如缺少 ComfyUI 则安装它，以及 Juggernaut XL 起始检查点（约 6.5 GB）。同一模型也用于本地编辑标签页。",
  "This sets up everything for a fully local run: ComfyUI itself if it’s missing, plus the starter model files.": "此操作为完全本地运行准备好一切：如缺少 ComfyUI 则安装它，以及起始模型文件。",
  "This sets up everything for fully local music: ComfyUI itself if it’s missing, plus the ACE Step 1.5 music model (~9.3 GB, runs from 6 GB VRAM). Local music is never filtered.": "此操作为完全本地音乐准备好一切：如缺少 ComfyUI 则安装它，以及 ACE Step 1.5 音乐模型（约 9.3 GB，6 GB VRAM 起可运行）。本地音乐永不过滤。",
  "This sets up the Wan 2.2 S2V model plus its audio encoder (~20 GB total).": "此操作将设置 Wan 2.2 S2V 模型及其音频编码器（共约 20 GB）。",
  "This sets up the Wan VACE motion model plus its support files (~10.5 GB, runs from 8 GB VRAM). The bigger Wan Animate variant is in the Model Manager.": "此操作将设置 Wan VACE 动作模型及其支持文件（约 10.5 GB，8 GB VRAM 起可运行）。更大的 Wan Animate 变体位于模型管理器中。",
  "This sets up the trainer's Python environment again: PyTorch and musubi-tuner get reinstalled. Your training photos and downloaded base models are not touched. Setup needs about 3 GB of downloads, same as the first install.": "这会重新配置训练器的 Python 环境：PyTorch 和 musubi-tuner 将被重新安装。你的训练照片和已下载的基础模型不会受影响。安装需要约 3 GB 下载量，与首次安装相同。",
